OL,3,GNEWSAGas worker had 'head in his hands'
OL,4,Aafter explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA colleague of the gas workers on trial
OL,7,Fover an explosion that killed 10 people
OL,8,Fsaid there was a sense of panic after
OL,9,Fthe incident.
OL,11,FLouis Savage, an operations service
OL,12,Flead for Island Energy, had worked to
OL,13,Frestore gas to nearby properties after
OL,14,Fsupplies were accidentally disconnected
OL,15,Fduring work the day before the Haut du
OL,16,FMont flats explosion took place on 10
OL,17,FDecember 2022.
OL,19,FSpeaking about the aftermath, Savage
OL,20,Ftold Jersey's Royal Court he found Neil
OL,21,FArmstrong sitting in his car with his
OL,22,F"head in his hands".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
