OL,3,GNEWSAGas worker had 'head in his hands'
OL,4,Aafter explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas workers Armstrong, 58, John Wright,
OL,7,F60, and Lee Ward, 59, deny 10 counts of
OL,8,Fgross negligence manslaughter and
OL,9,FIsland Energy has also pleaded not
OL,10,Fguilty in a combined health and safety
OL,11,Fcase.
